So, I worked on this today, and it seems to be really an initialization=
 problem. Here's my patch for 2.0.10-4. (Is there a better way to submi=
t it? I'm new here.)

Do you have a test suit I could run to make sure I didn't break anythin=
g?

thanks,
-- Lu=C3=ADs Fernando





